NOTICE ON QUOTED VENDOR TEXT
----------------------------
Records contain short quoted spans from vendor pages in the `evidence_quote`,
`status_quote`, `regions_quote` and `tiers[].quote` fields. These are limited to
the shortest text necessary to substantiate a factual claim, are always
attributed to the source URL in `official_source`, and remain the property of
their respective owners. Company and program names are used nominatively to
identify the programs described. This dataset is not affiliated with, endorsed
by, or sponsored by any vendor listed.

NO WARRANTY
-----------
Program terms change without notice. This dataset is provided as-is, with a
`last_verified` date and a `verification_level` on every record precisely so you
can judge how much to trust each one. Always confirm terms with the vendor
before making a decision.
